							発行台帳</a></li>
				</ul></li>
			<li class="main-nav__item"><a class="main-nav__trigger"
				href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/attendance/attendance-management.do">勤怠管理</a>
				<ul class="dropdown-menu">
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/attendance/attendance-management.do">勤怠記録/管理</a></li>
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
